      <div class="cs-swatch">
        <div class="cs-swatch-inner">
          <div class="cs-swatch-img" {% if section.settings.cs_fab_1_image %}style="background-image:url('{{ section.settings.cs_fab_1_image | image_url: width: 400 }}')"{% endif %}></div>
          <div class="cs-swatch-ribbon">CLOUDSOFT&#10;&#8482;</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-cell cs-cell-bl"><h4>FLUID MOVEMENT</h4><p>4-way stretch that adapts naturally to your body.</p></div>
    <div class="cs-cell cs-cell-br"><h4>EVERYDAY ESSENTIAL</h4><p>Made for daily wear with all-day ease.</p></div>
  </div>

  <div class="cs-fab-panel" data-cs="1">
    <div class="cs-cell cs-cell-tl"><h4>SILK-LIKE TOUCH</h4><p>Smooth, polished softness with a refined hand feel.</p></div>
    <div class="cs-cell cs-cell-tr"><h4>BALANCED BREATHABILITY</h4><p>Keeps you comfortable across changing moments.</p></div>
    <div class="cs-swatch-wrap">
      <div class="cs-swatch">
        <div class="cs-swatch-inner">
          <div class="cs-swatch-img" {% if section.settings.cs_fab_2_image %}style="background-image:url('{{ section.settings.cs_fab_2_image | image_url: width: 400 }}')"{% else if section.settings.cs_fab_1_image %}style="background-image:url('{{ section.settings.cs_fab_1_image | image_url: width: 400 }}')"{% endif %}></div>
          <div class="cs-swatch-ribbon">SILK-LIKE LUXURY</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-cell cs-cell-bl"><h4>LIGHT STRETCH</h4><p>Gentle flexibility that moves without effort.</p></div>
    <div class="cs-cell cs-cell-br"><h4>ELEVATED EASE</h4><p>Perfect for lounging or dressing up your basics.</p></div>
